<%
  @magic_link = user_magic_link_url(@resource, @scope_name => {email: @resource.email, token: @token, remember_me: @remember_me})
%>
Your magic link is ready
========================
Hi there,
Click the link below to sign in to your ProdFinder account:
<%= @magic_link %>
IMPORTANT: This link expires in <%= Devise.passwordless_login_within.inspect %> and can only be used once for your security.
HOW TO USE YOUR MAGIC LINK
---------------------------
1. Click the link above (or copy and paste it into your browser)
2. You'll be signed in automatically
3. You'll be redirected to your dashboard
DIDN'T REQUEST THIS EMAIL?
---------------------------
If you didn't request this magic link, you can safely ignore this email.
Someone may have entered your email address by mistake.
SECURITY NOTE
-------------
ProdFinder will never ask you for your password via email. This link
provides secure, passwordless access to your account.
--
This email was sent by ProdFinder
<%= root_url %>
